         "question": "3.Refill Guidelines",
         "answerBlocks": [
          {
           "type": "rich-text",
           "content": "<div>The refill filament needs to be used with a spool. For detailed instructions on how to swap in the new filament using the Bambu Reusable Spool, please refer to the <a href=\"https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/general/swaping-new-filament-with-bambu-reusable-spool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\">guide</span></span></a> on WIKI.</div>",
