        },
        {
         "question": "4.Safety Tips",
         "answerBlocks": [
          {
           "type": "rich-text",
           "content": "<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Please store the filament in a cool, dark, and dry environment away from direct sunlight and high temperatures.</li>\n<li>Please keep filament and any broken fragments out of reach of infants, children, and pets to prevent swallowing or choking.</li>\n<li>For opened filament, we recommend drying before use according to the wiki&rsquo;s recommended temperature and time settings.</li>\n<li>Please print this filament in a well-ventilated area, or install an effective air filtration or exhaust system.</li>\n<li>As this filament is not food-grade, please avoid using finished prints for food storage or contact.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>As this filament is highly moisture-absorbent, please place any unused filament in a sealed container with desiccant immediately, and dry thoroughly before printing.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
           "id": "comp_1790040601598_5qrv6cofj"
          }
